  "headCont": "빛 파동",
  "contentval": "000Nmzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHp/1474",
  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">빛의 굴절 수업에서 </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">원통형 물통 뒤 화살표 관찰하기</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">많이들 해 보셨지요</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">? 2015 </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">개정 </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">1</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">학년 교과서에도 소개된 내용입니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">단</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">화살표를 물통 바로 뒤에 두지 말고 거리를 띄워야</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">(</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">화살표가 선명하게 보이도록 거리 조절</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">) </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">그렇게 보입니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d9634d4bab8c1e267c1fa0173e7ee8a60ed5ab1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d9634d4bab8c1e267c1fa0173e7ee8a60ed5ab1\" data-origin-width=\"800\" data-origin-height=\"450\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">※ </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">물을 반 정도만 담고 물이 있는 쪽과 없는 쪽 뒤에서 화살표의 방향이 어떻게 되는지 바로 비교하는 방법도 있습니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">.(</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">물이 없는 쪽 뒤에는 화살표 방향 불변</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">결과는</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">? </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">물 뒤쪽 화살표의 좌우 방향이 바뀝니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. (</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">상하 방향 화살표를 관찰하면 방향 불변</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a05fbda25a7e93d700e21e431a7776634c56ae6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1a05fbda25a7e93d700e21e431a7776634c56ae6\" data-origin-width=\"342\" data-origin-height=\"529\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d51c5b86f1d7288e3f116e6a2f173a385e919b0b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d51c5b86f1d7288e3f116e6a2f173a385e919b0b\" data-origin-width=\"294\" data-origin-height=\"703\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">원통형 물통이 곡면이 있는 방향으로만 빛을 굴절시키기 때문입니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">혹시 원통형 물통을 세우지 않고 눕혀 보았을까요</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">? </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">결과는</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">? </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">화살표의 상하 방향이 바뀝니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. (</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">좌우 방향 화살표를 관찰하면 방향 불변</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">)</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/038f81943371000975897200c45211f03ba657a2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/038f81943371000975897200c45211f03ba657a2\" data-origin-width=\"702\" data-origin-height=\"384\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f1124ada638f73a4cba58a6f2db4b95ed117ff5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2f1124ada638f73a4cba58a6f2db4b95ed117ff5\" data-origin-width=\"921\" data-origin-height=\"407\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">둥근 유리구슬을 통해서 관찰하면? 좌우상하 반전이 일어납니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">둥근 유리구슬은 볼록렌즈와 같은 역할을 하기 때문입니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">빛의 굴절 현상을 알아보는 방법 가운데 프리즘을 통해 보는 눈이 우스꽝스럽게 보이는 현상이 있는데요</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">프리즘의 각도를 적절히 조절하여 위쪽과 아래쪽에서 동시에 굴절된 눈을 관찰할 수도 있습니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68430fe889d1e039efc5ab25939e0ec73dd092cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/68430fe889d1e039efc5ab25939e0ec73dd092cb\" data-origin-width=\"320\" data-origin-height=\"240\"></div><p><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">프리즘 대신 원통형 물통을 눕혀서 사용할 때 눈이 더 크고 재미있게 보입니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">물을 가득 담았을 때와 반 정도 담았을 때 눈의 모습 비교하기도 흥미롭습니다</span><span style=\"color: #0a0a0a;\" data-ke-size=\"size20\">. </span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1f74ffd882e927ab894b9e55d9b0a5265ab47a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e1f74ffd882e927ab894b9e55d9b0a5265ab47a3\" data-origin-width=\"808\" data-origin-height=\"246\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}